# Zoraline, Cosmos Caller: "you may pay {W}{B} and 2 life. When you do, return target nonland permanent card ...". The only
# permanent card in Bot1's graveyard is Urza's Saga, a land (Entomb, beside it, is an instant). Paying is still allowed -
# the target is chosen by the reflexive trigger, not by the payment (its ruling) - so turn 3 Bot1 pays {W}{B} and 2 life
# as her enters trigger resolves; the reflexive trigger then has no legal target and is removed from the stack (CR
# 603.3d), and the payment stays paid: 18 life, nothing returned, nothing on the stack.

